§§ `Articles 28 and 29 — termination`

#ASSERT `28 — the part ends on` `the death of the Insured Member`
#ASSERT `28 — the part ends on` `the Maturity Date of the part`
#ASSERT `29.1 — the Contract ends on` `the number of Insured Members falls below the agreed minimum`

GIVEN `evidence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `contacted` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `The New Organisation's position`
`a New Organisation established 1 April 2026: evidence` `evidence` `, contacted` `contacted` MEANS
    `The New Organisation's position` WITH
        `evidence that it took over all the Policyholder's rights and obligations` IS `evidence`
        `date on its establishment certificate or decision`                         IS YMD 2026 4 1
        `date it contacted the Company to become the Policyholder`                  IS `contacted`

-- 29.2(a) dissolution: "will consider". 29.2(b) merger: 1 April + 30 = 1 May 2026.
#ASSERT `29.2 — what becomes of a part when the Contract ends on` `the Policyholder is dissolved, bankrupt or closed by a state decision` `, with the New Organisation's position` (`a New Organisation established 1 April 2026: evidence` FALSE `, contacted` NOTHING) `, as at` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS `the Company will consider converting the part to an individual policy or ending it under Article 22`
#ASSERT `29.2 — what becomes of a part when the Contract ends on` `the Policyholder ceases by division, merger or consolidation` `, with the New Organisation's position` (`a New Organisation established 1 April 2026: evidence` TRUE `, contacted` (JUST (YMD 2026 5 1))) `, as at` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS `the New Organisation becomes the Policyholder`
#ASSERT `29.2 — what becomes of a part when the Contract ends on` `the Policyholder ceases by division, merger or consolidation` `, with the New Organisation's position` (`a New Organisation established 1 April 2026: evidence` TRUE `, contacted` (JUST (YMD 2026 5 2))) `, as at` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS `the Company will consider converting the part to an individual policy or ending it under Article 22`
#ASSERT `29.2 — what becomes of a part when the Contract ends on` `the Policyholder ceases by division, merger or consolidation` `, with the New Organisation's position` (`a New Organisation established 1 April 2026: evidence` TRUE `, contacted` NOTHING) `, as at` (YMD 2026 4 20) EQUALS `the New Organisation is still within its 30 days`
#ASSERT `29.2 — what becomes of a part when the Contract ends on` `the Policyholder ceases by division, merger or consolidation` `, with the New Organisation's position` (`a New Organisation established 1 April 2026: evidence` FALSE `, contacted` (JUST (YMD 2026 4 2))) `, as at` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS `the Company will consider converting the part to an individual policy or ending it under Article 22`
#ASSERT `29.2 — what becomes of a part when the Contract ends on` `the Contract term ends, the Policyholder asks to end it, or every part has ended` `, with the New Organisation's position` (`a New Organisation established 1 April 2026: evidence` FALSE `, contacted` NOTHING) `, as at` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS `the Company may consider converting the part to an individual policy or ending it under Article 22`
#TRACE `29.2(b) — the New Organisation's duty to contact the Company` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 31)

GIVEN `born` IS A DATE
      `years` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The person's particulars`
`an Insured Member at termination on 1 June 2026, born` `born` `, years worked` `years` MEANS
    `The person's particulars` WITH
        `as at`                                          IS YMD 2026 6 1
        `date of birth`                                  IS `born`
        `recorded in the List of Insured Members`        IS TRUE
        `present in Vietnam`                             IS TRUE
        `holds a valid Enrolment Form`                   IS TRUE
        `premium for this person paid to the Company`    IS TRUE
        `resident in Vietnam`                            IS TRUE
        `of full civil capacity under the Civil Code`    IS TRUE
        `full years of employment with the Policyholder` IS `years`

#ASSERT `29.3 — applies to a part when the Contract ends on` `the Policyholder ceases by division, merger or consolidation`
#ASSERT NOT `29.3 — applies to a part when the Contract ends on` `the Policyholder breaches the law or the Contract`
-- Policyholder's account 60,000,000, current vesting 30% (18,000,000).
-- 10 years worked: 100% = 60,000,000.
#ASSERT `29.3 — the Vested Account Value at termination, for` (`an Insured Member at termination on 1 June 2026, born` (YMD 1990 1 1) `, years worked` (JUST 10)) `with accounts` `the usual accounts` EQUALS 60_000_000
-- 9 years, aged 44 (born 2 June 1981): the greater of 18,000,000 and 90% = 54,000,000.
#ASSERT `29.3 — the Vested Account Value at termination, for` (`an Insured Member at termination on 1 June 2026, born` (YMD 1981 6 2) `, years worked` (JUST 9)) `with accounts` `the usual accounts` EQUALS 54_000_000
-- 9 years, aged 45 that day (born 1 June 1981): 100%.
#ASSERT `29.3 — the Vested Account Value at termination, for` (`an Insured Member at termination on 1 June 2026, born` (YMD 1981 6 1) `, years worked` (JUST 9)) `with accounts` `the usual accounts` EQUALS 60_000_000
-- 2 years: the greater of 18,000,000 and 20% (12,000,000) = 18,000,000.
#ASSERT `29.3 — the Vested Account Value at termination, for` (`an Insured Member at termination on 1 June 2026, born` (YMD 1990 1 1) `, years worked` (JUST 2)) `with accounts` `the usual accounts` EQUALS 18_000_000
